# Authoritative records under .research/{events,tasks,runs,handoffs,sources,segments,claims,entities,gaps,conflicts,edges} remain ignored.
# Persisted locally via polder_research.atomic.write_atomic with schema validation.
# Tracking them is a one-way door — see AUDIT.md "Persistence mode (resolved)".
.research/state.json
.research/health.json
.research/events/*.json
.research/tasks/*.json
.research/runs/*.json
.research/handoffs/*.json
.research/maintenance/*.json
.research/locks/*.json
.research/generated/*
